#==============================================================================================
#
#   interpolation_2 - CSS interpolation: grid track lists and interpolate_property
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/CSS/Interpolation.cpp (lines 533-833), by region p4a:
#       expanding a grid track list into tracks and line names and interpolating two of them,
#       interpolate_property (keywords resolved, then by the property's animation type: by
#       computed value, repeatable list, or the custom rules of transform, shadows, font-style,
#       font-variation-settings, visibility, content-visibility, display, scale, translate,
#       rotate, filters, grid templates and stroke-dasharray, else discrete), and whether two
#       values of a property are transitionable.
